# The password rules of the forced change, checked before any request:
# a new password of three characters is refused with the length limits,
# then the old password repeated as the new one is refused too; the
# fields keep what was typed.  Esc and Y then log out, and Esc on the
# login screen ends the program.
T NEWBIE
K ENTER
T newbie86
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
T newbie86
K TAB
T abc
K TAB
T abc
K CTRL-S
S SHORT
K STAB CTRL-Y
T newbie86
K TAB CTRL-Y
T newbie86
K CTRL-S
S SAME
K ESC
T Y
S LOGIN
K ESC
